  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Education and Protection Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the inclusive learning needs of vulnerable boys and girls affected by the earthquakes, prevent and respond to children who are at risk of drop out, and facilitate their adaptation to the regular learning process, with an emphasis on reducing the number of children out of school, closing equity gaps and implementing learning recovery programmes at basic and upper secondary education levels; Complemented by child protection interventions with a focus on preventing and responding to gender-based violence (GBV).</narrative>
  </description>
